{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.asahi.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她比上课时间早到了一个多小时",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.asahi.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.asahi.second",
    "idolId": "asahi",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "这里……这样。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "然后……嘿！",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "あさひ，早上好。来得真早啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "嗯……有点不对……这里这样……",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（好厉害的集中力……好，等她跳完吧。）",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "好……！",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "あさひ，早上好。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "啊，制作人先生，早上好！",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，第一天就这么有干劲，佩服。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "我想早点做！上次你给我看的那个影像太厉害了。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。不过话说回来，你集中力真厉害。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "？　什么意思？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我喊你好像完全没听见，所以在佩服。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "原来是那样……我都没注意到。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（一集中就看不见周围了啊……得帮她注意着点。）",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "话说，制作人先生是来做什么的？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今天是第一次上课，我想在旁边看着。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "哦～原来是这样。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "那我可要全力以赴了，请看着我！制作人先生！",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不……之后的课上会好好看的，没关系——",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "……呼。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "……！",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "挺厉害的。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "先热身。",
            "nextNodeId": "110"
          },
          {
            "label": "我在旁边看着。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "嘿嘿……被夸了。",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真的。第一节课就这个状态，很厉害。",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "那我，下次要跳得更好！"
      },
      "110": {
        "id": "110",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "热身？……对，要先让身体醒过来。",
        "nextNodeId": "111"
      },
      "111": {
        "id": "111",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。急不得。",
        "nextNodeId": "112"
      },
      "112": {
        "id": "112",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "知道了！那我先跑一圈！"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "那就，请你一直看着！",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，我会看着。",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "好！那我，开始了！"
      }
    }
  },
